MACHINE-READABLE ATTRIBUTION (`--json`)
---------------------------------------
A `--json` run prints one `connections` object per session: the socket's own connID, how
many `signal` frames were its own, and every frame it ignored because the connID belonged
to another live session of the account. This is the object an automated check should read.

